#Castle Brian Reinforced Weapons Bunker.
#Capital scale Construction Factor and armor from the source are converted to standard scale here
#(x10), because MegaMek buildings have no capital scale. Classified as Fortress: Castle Brian is not
#an implemented building class, and Fortress is the closest, halving damage taken.
#Quarters, infantry compartments, industrial elevators and the subterranean level cannot be
#represented - the building loader reads no transporters and no basements.

